  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p>Now finding elements where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> divides&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Also given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p>Now finding elements when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> divides&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>, we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, Number of relations&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
